    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d589">

                <pb facs="0582" n="484" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg484"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Thiébaut.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-09-18"><hi rendition="#italic">September 18,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 350.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Upon its receipt, on the 13th instant, I
                    repeated to the governor of Texas the touching and highly appreciated message of
                    condolence from His Excellency the President of France on account of the
                    disaster at Galveston.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to inclose copy of a telegram which I have received from the
                    governor, indicating his wish that, through you, his thanks may be conveyed to
                    the Government of France for its expression of sympathy.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d589-a1.xml" xpointer="d589-a1"/>
